english:
{n}Giving you a smile of darkest sorrow, Ulfar concludes grimly:{/n}
"To harsh retribution
their blood calls us;
Fenris remembers all,
Fenris forgives nothing."

{n}Ulfar's voice becomes low and heavy with dire warning:{/n}
"Stand aside, young brother,
Our foe is wounded,
but well-banked is his malice
and still smouldering;
My lot will be
his blow to meet;
My hide ere carries
scars aplenty."

Of the baleful pack worthy
was the hunt,
Their name will thunder
at the feast of victory;
Doom's scream I ripped out,
Leaving it to cry
a tongueless, silent wail;
Wolf's howl has flown,
Above hall arches soaring...
{n}Ulfar falls silent and gives you a pensive look.{/n}
